================================================================================
DATA STRUCTURES & ALGORITHMS LABORATORY MANUAL
Course: CS301 | 12 Practical Experiments
================================================================================

Experiment 1: Infix to Postfix Conversion using Stacks
Experiment 2: Circular Queue Implementation with Dynamic Resizing
Experiment 3: Binary Search Tree (BST) Insertion, Deletion & AVL Balancing
Experiment 4: Min/Max Heap and Heapsort Algorithm
Experiment 5: Graph Representation (Adjacency Matrix vs List)
Experiment 6: Dijkstra's Single Source Shortest Path Algorithm
Experiment 7: Prim's and Kruskal's Minimum Spanning Tree (MST)
Experiment 8: Dynamic Programming: 0/1 Knapsack Problem
Experiment 9: Longest Common Subsequence (LCS) Implementation
Experiment 10: Trie Data Structure for Fast Autocomplete

Source code implementations are provided in C++ standard 17 with memory cleanup.
